#: glade/gimmix.ui:318
msgid ""
"Please select the directory where your music is stored. This is required for "
"gimmix to function properly.\n"
"Note: The directory should be same as what you specified in your mpd "
"settings. If you're not sure,\n"
"Check your mpd configuration file (/etc/mpd.conf on most systems)."
